    {
      "narration": "Then I found the list. Every year, one sky kid is chosen to clean the mirrors at the edge. Nobody ever comes back. This year's name: *Leo*.",
      "setting": "sky_mirrors",
      "action": "mirrors",
      "shot": "pull_back",
